7ec5497:bytedance/lagrange_torch/csrc/local_prebuilt/BUILD:9:# It must stay a standalone package BUILD file (not a ``load()``ed library like
7ec5497:bytedance/lagrange_torch/csrc/local_prebuilt/BUILD:11:#   1. blade resolves a prebuilt cc_library's .so/.a as
